<div class="card" style="border:0"><h2 style="font-size:30px;line-height:1.15">Getting your account</h2><p>Your director or teacher sets up your account. You'll get a registration code or an email invitation from your program. Program Partner doesn't create accounts on its own, so if you haven't heard anything, ask your director or teacher.</p></div>
<div class="card" style="border:0"><h2 style="font-size:30px;line-height:1.15">Signing in</h2><p>Go to <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" style="font-weight:600">app.myprogrampartner.com</a>. It works on any phone, tablet or computer. On a phone or tablet, you can add it to your home screen so it opens like an app. There's nothing to download.</p></div>
